<h3>Widget power sparkline <span class="pro-badge">Pro</span></h3>
<p>
  The desktop widget shows a power chart alongside cable status, updated periodically by macOS on its own schedule (not continuously). Glance at your desktop and see charging trends without opening anything.
</p>
